प्रति-√ कृ P. Ā. -करोति, -कुरुते, (inf. प्रती-कर्तुम्, BhP.), to do or make an opposition, AitBr.;
to return, repay, requite (good or evil [acc.], with gen. dat. or loc. of pers.), MBh.; R. &c.;
to counteract, resist (acc. or gen.), ib.;
to treat, attend to, cure (a disease), Suśr.;
to repair, mend, restore, Mn.;
to pay back (a debt), Gaut. :
Caus. Ā. -कारयते, to cause to be repeated, ŚBr. :
Desid. -चिकीर्षति, to wish to take revenge on (acc. or loc.) for (acc.), MBh.; R.

प्रति-√ क्रम् P. -क्रामति (pf. -चक्राम and -चक्रमे), to come back, return, ŚBr.; ChUp.; MBh.;
to descend, decrease (in number, opp. to अभि-√ क्रम्), Nid.;
to confess, Śatr.

प्रति-√ क्षिप् P. -क्षिपति (cf. Pāṇ. i, 3, 80), to throw into (loc.), MBh. (v.l. परि-);
to push against, hurt, Suśr.;
to reject, despise, oppose, contradict, ridicule, confute, Kathās.; Sarvad.; Lalit.

(प्रति-√ ईक्ष्) Ā. प्रतिक्षते (ep. also P. ˚ति), to look at, behold, perceive, AV.; KātyŚr.;
to look forward to, wait for, expect, TS. &c. &c.;
to look at with indifference, bear with, tolerate (acc.), Mn. ix, 77.
